      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Boom colt LOUCASSO (10) set an Australasian record for his age with a stunning win last week, stretching his winning streak to seven and taking his perfect record at this circuit and distance to four. Draws out and has some talented three-year-olds inside him so this will be more of challenge but he has the brilliance to overcome the barrier. NSW Derby placegetter YOTTIE (5) made it three from three this time in with a fighting win last week. Has the speed to take advantage of this draw. That should give him his chance. NOCTURNAL (6) did a great job to finish just over 2m off LOUCASSO last week given the scorching time. He has really developed some consistency, as has ALERT BAY (9) who was good again after working last week and won well prior. Both of those of colts have been competitive with LOUCASSO of late and could push him again.",
